

# <type>(<scope>): <subject>          ← ≤72 字符,不以句号结尾
#
# type : feat fix refactor docs test chore build ci perf style
# scope: renderer tb-client compiler deploy-tool docs adr repo hooks ci
#
# body : 改了什么、为什么、怎么验证的(每行 ≤ 100 字符)
#
# Refs: T1.2                          ← feat/fix/refactor/test/perf 必填
# BREAKING CHANGE: ...                ← 契约变更时写,并同步 ADR
